  "summary": {
    "text": "Gemini 3.5 Flash is a multimodal language model in Google's Gemini Flash line and the first model of the Gemini 3.5 series, generally available from 19 May 2026 in the Gemini API, Agent Platform, the Gemini app and AI Mode in Search, where it became the default. Google positions it for agentic, coding and long-running tasks, including running subagents.",
